---
// FounderNote.astro
---
<section class="py-24 bg-white border-b border-slate-100">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
    
    <!-- Founder Image / Badge Box (4 Cols) -->
    <div class="md:col-span-4 text-center md:text-left">
      <div class="w-32 h-32 md:w-40 md:h-40 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500 to-teal-700 mx-auto md:mx-0 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-5xl font-extrabold shadow-xl">
        Y
      </div>
      <div class="mt-4">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">Yashotkarsh Apoorva</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-emerald-600 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">Founder & Lead Developer</p>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">YNS Web Studio, Jaipur</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Note Content (8 Cols) -->
    <div class="md:col-span-8 text-left space-y-4">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-600 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
        A Personal Note To Business Owners
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
        "Why I Started YNS Web Studio — No Middlemen, Just Pure Results."
      </h2>

      <p class="text-slate-600 text-base leading-relaxed">
        Most local business owners in Jaipur have had a bad experience with web agencies: delayed projects, hidden costs, and zero enquiries after paying thousands. 
      </p>

      <p class="text-slate-600 text-base leading-relaxed">
        When you work with YNS Web Studio, you aren't handed off to junior interns or account managers. <strong class="text-slate-900">I personally design, architect, and optimize your website</strong> with a singular focus: getting your phone ringing and your WhatsApp buzzing with genuine customer enquiries.
      </p>

      <div class="pt-2">
        <a 
          href="https://wa.me/919352563337" 
          target="_blank"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold text-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-700 transition-colors"
        >
          💬 Ping me directly on WhatsApp to discuss your project →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>